  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      208.15,
      451.23,
      237.14
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 4 of the Shrama Vasana Fund Act, No. 12 of 1998(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section as amendedis to increase the membership of the Board of Trustees of the Shrama Vasana Fund.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      248.11,
      451.23,
      267.14
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3: This clause amends section 6 of the principal enactment and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to widen the objects of the Shrama Vasana Fund by\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      180.91,
      278.11,
      451.19,
      297.14
    ],
    "text": "(a)extending the welfare and medical facilities to the dependents of the employeesof the Fund; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      180.91,
      308.11,
      451.21,
      327.14
    ],
    "text": "(b)enabling to provide financial relief to obtain legal assistance to employees incase of termination of employment or in case of industrial dispute.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      338.11,
      451.23,
      367.22
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4: This clause amends section 7 of the principal enactment and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to make certain amendments to the powers and functions of the NationalLotteries Board.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      378.07,
      451.18,
      407.18
    ],
    "text": "Clause 5: This clause amends section 13 of the principal enactment and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to incorporate in that section certain provisions applicable for the Lotteryconducted by the National Lotteries Board under the provisions of the principal enactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      418.15,
      451.19,
      447.14
    ],
    "text": "Clause 6: This clause amends section 14 of the principal enactment and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to set out the procedure to be followed in making rules by the NationalLotteries Board.",
